    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d128">

                <pb facs="0279" n="187" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp01v01/pg187"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/13488</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Great Britain</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Page</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-03-30T08:00:00+01:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 30, 1918, 8 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received March 80, 7.55 a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>9285. For the Secretary of State and the President:</p>
                <p>The Prime Minister said to me, privately, that he thinks it probable that the
                    present battle will lead to the appointment of executor [<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >executive</hi>] generalissimo.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Page</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
